					<section class="masthead masthead--home-page" id="masthead">
				<div class="masthead__wrapper">
																		<div class="video" data-video-path="https://jjc.edu/sites/default/files/2026-11/November%202026.mp4" data-video-path-backup="https://jjc.edu/sites/default/files/2026-11/November%202026.webm" data-id="js-masthead-video"></div>
												<div class="image js-multi-image" data-images="https://jjc.edu/sites/default/files/styles/home_masthead/public/2026-11/november2.jpg?itok=y93FC5oR,https://jjc.edu/sites/default/files/styles/home_masthead/public/2026-11/november3.jpg?itok=1cl3YNkS,https://jjc.edu/sites/default/files/styles/home_masthead/public/2026-11/november4.jpg?itok=RdC4fXVa,https://jjc.edu/sites/default/files/styles/home_masthead/public/2026-11/november1.jpg?itok=8VHqMRkQ"></div>
						<noscript>
							<div class="image" style="background-image: url(https://jjc.edu/sites/default/files/styles/home_masthead/public/2026-11/november4.jpg?itok=RdC4fXVa)"></div>
						</noscript>
										<div class="masthead__banner">
						<div class="inner">
							<h1>Dare to think forward </h1>
							<p>Ready to launch into what&#039;s next? Plan ahead now for spring 2027 classes: registration is open!</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		
		
							<section class="career-pathways">
											<div class="career-pathways__content">
															<h2>Choose Your Pathway</h2>
							
															<p>Explore our academic areas designed around your strengths, interests and goals. We&#039;ll help you move forward with the path that&#039;s best for you. </p>
													</div>
					
					<span class="show-for-sr">Keyboard navigation tip: Use tab or shift+tab to navigate through the active three pathways in the following carousel, and the arrow buttons to progress to the next and previous groups.</span>
					<div class="career-pathways__slider" id="career-pathways">
																					<div  data-history-node-id="9116" class="career-pathways__item">
	<figure class="career-pathway">
		<div class="image" aria-label="student with cat" style="background-image: url('https://jjc.edu/sites/default/files/styles/pathway/public/2023-09/pathway%201%20-%20vet%20tech.jpg?itok=EWT5sS2a');"></div>
		<figcaption class="career-pathway__overlay" tabindex="-1">
			<div class="career-pathway__overlay-wrapper">
				<h3 class="career-pathway__title">Agricultural Sciences &amp; Veterinary Technology</h3>
				<div class="career-pathway__content">
											<p>This pathway is a great fit if you’re practical, enjoy hands-on work outdoors or working with animals. You can expect to learn from experienced, expert instructors who care about student success. </p>
										<a href="/choose-your-path/agricultural-sciences-vet-tech" title="Learn More about Agricultural Sciences &amp; Veterinary Technology" class="career-pathway__link" tabindex="0">
						<svg class='icon icon-arrow'><use xlink:href='#icon-arrow'></use></svg>
            <span class='text'>Learn More about Agricultural Sciences &amp; Veterinary Technology</span>

					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</figcaption>
	</figure>
</div>
															<div  data-history-node-id="9126" class="career-pathways__item">
	<figure class="career-pathway">
		<div class="image" aria-label="student with automotive diagnostic tool" style="background-image: url('https://jjc.edu/sites/default/files/styles/pathway/public/2023-09/pathway%202%20-%20automotive.jpg?itok=FXZ7cGOY');"></div>
		<figcaption class="career-pathway__overlay" tabindex="-1">
			<div class="career-pathway__overlay-wrapper">
				<h3 class="career-pathway__title">Architecture, Manufacturing &amp; Automotive</h3>
				<div class="career-pathway__content">
											<p>If you enjoy building or repairing machines or other structures, figuring out how things work and solving hands-on mechanical problems, this pathway is for you.</p>
										<a href="/choose-your-path/architecture-manufacturing-automotive" title="Learn More about Architecture, Manufacturing &amp; Automotive" class="career-pathway__link" tabindex="0">
						<svg class='icon icon-arrow'><use xlink:href='#icon-arrow'></use></svg>
            <span class='text'>Learn More about Architecture, Manufacturing &amp; Automotive</span>

					</a>
				</div>
